## 🔐 Authentication Flow

```
1. User lands on "/" → Shows LoginPage
2. Enters credentials → AuthContext.login()
3. Validates against localStorage users
4. Sets current user → Redirect based on role
   - Admin/Cashier → /dashboard
   - Barber → /reports
5. PrivateRoute checks auth on each route
6. Sidebar shows role-appropriate navigation
```

