```

### Sale
```typescript
{
  id, ticketNumber, customerName?,
  items: [SaleLineItem],
  subtotal, discount, tax, total,
  paymentMethod, cashReceived?, change?,
  totalCommission, cashierId, cashierName,
  notes?, createdAt
